    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello, Guys! I\u2019m a beginner who has just embarked on the journey of game development, and with a grateful heart, I present my first indie game attempt to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Return to Music Galaxy&quot; is a unique light-hearted music game that combines various modes. In the game, you\u2019ll play as a mysterious slime, collecting energy through rhythm-based clicking to power a spaceship while uncovering its hidden story. There are four different music game modes, such as falling notes, spinning notes, and ping-pong-style rhythm challenges, offering a variety of gameplay experiences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As this is my first creation, I\u2019m eager to hear your feedback and suggestions. Although I faced many challenges during the development process, I enjoyed every moment of it. I truly hope this game brings you some fun and relaxation. Whether you're a fan of rhythm games or just looking for a casual way to unwind, give it a try! I look forward to hearing your thoughts after you play. Thank you all so much for your support!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello, Guys! I\u2019m a beginner who has just embarked on the journey of game development, and with a grateful heart, I present my first indie game attempt to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Return to Music Galaxy&quot; is a unique light-hearted music game that combines various modes. In the game, you\u2019ll play as a mysterious slime, collecting energy through rhythm-based clicking to power a spaceship while uncovering its hidden story. There are four different music game modes, such as falling notes, spinning notes, and ping-pong-style rhythm challenges, offering a variety of gameplay experiences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As this is my first creation, I\u2019m eager to hear your feedback and suggestions. Although I faced many challenges during the development process, I enjoyed every moment of it. I truly hope this game brings you some fun and relaxation. Whether you're a fan of rhythm games or just looking for a casual way to unwind, give it a try! I look forward to hearing your thoughts after you play. Thank you all so much for your support!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A light and casual music game with multiple nested modes. In game, players take on the role of a slime with an unknown background, collecting energy through rhythm-based gameplay to power up a spaceship and uncover its story.",
